Package: galaxy-terminal
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: x-terminal-emulator
Description: GTK 3 and XApp terminal for Wayland
 A tabbed terminal using VTE, with searchable scrollback, editable profiles,
 configurable shortcuts, background opacity and an XApp preferences window.
 Requires a Wayland session. Does not restore running sessions after closing.
